        "description": {
          "en-US": "Stride is a task management application with built-in Git integration.\nCreate and sync tasks using a Git provider such as GitHub, GitLab, or\nSourceHut, or use a self-hosted server.\n\nStride is currently in alpha, so features and behavior may change.\n\nThis development build includes the latest changes and may be unstable.\n\nStride Development and Stride can be installed alongside each other."
